{"id":"b7b09130f8acb2522d6b1273730a1836","note_id":"game-macro","at":"2026-11-10T02:53:32.014970+00:00","origin":"import","body_sha256":"9b61f088cef77a03cadd69c201da3821fa4e5fd945f3c6f6d33b6ebc548877a1","review_refs":[],"record":{"body":{"schema_version":6,"leading":"","nodes":[{"id":"g-1c9d03415a033a9c38cf","type":"heading","level":1,"title":"游戏大局观","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"type":"entry","id":"n-0eb1de62a6360866bf1b","key":"名次目标与阶段安排","show_key":true,"value":"回合投入应服务于当前名次目标。前期评估可承担的掉血和成长启动时间，中期检查成型条件能否按期满足，后期根据仍在场的主要对手决定维持当前阵容或调整针对手段。具体判断见[游戏决策逻辑](api/notes/game-decisions/reading)。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-22a2f53d939fc1fe05a1","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"前期目标","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"rw-simple-draft-game-macro","type":"entry","key":"阵营禁用如何改变开局选择","value":"阵营禁用会同时改变己方可用的英雄、对手可能选择的打法和终局常见的克制关系。选棋手时，先确认计划能否在剩余阵营中起步，以及缺少关键组件时是否还有替代路线。再估计常见对手会在何时形成战力。若多数对手前期较弱，慢速成长路线有机会提前积累资源。若多数对手较早强化，选有即时战力和替代路线的棋手，通常更能承受前几轮的不利来牌。","show_key":true,"separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-05cde3faa0c2e9313e3d","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"中期发展","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-2129555de1f4d5070b83","type":"entry","key":"前两轮拍卖补核心","show_key":true,"value":"计划通过拍卖补齐核心英雄，应重视前两次拍卖。第二次拍卖结束后仍缺核心英雄时，可改用商店刷新寻找核心英雄。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-17a2ab40ff5c77d80979","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"后期收束","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"rw-simple-game-macro","type":"entry","key":"成长阵容转入终局的时机","show_key":true,"value":"有些阵容依靠反复打出低阶英雄或效果牌提高等级，但实际战斗需要能把等级转化为伤害、控制或生存能力的英雄。当主要对手已经成型，且当前阵容即使再成长一轮也难以改善交手结果时，应在等级转移材料和接收者齐备后尽早变阵。若当前阵容仍能承受一轮且接收者尚未就绪，可以延后替换，优先保留能完成转移的资源。","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-a8ef5ed5dcd49c4fe4be","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"夺冠与保名次","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-6b80fd27bccb0e803962","type":"heading","level":2,"title":"转型与投入","space":" ","separator":"\n\n"},{"id":"g-d68ac9bbb4de17aabcb2","type":"entry","key":"转型前保留等级转移手段","show_key":true,"value":"准备转阵容、且场上已有不适合新阵容的高等级英雄时，提前确认可用的等级转移效果牌，避免换人时丢掉前期积累。具体接收目标和适用范围要按效果牌分别判断。","separator":"\n\n"}],"supporting_nodes":[],"semantics":{}},"metadata":{"id":"game-macro","type":"other","title":"游戏大局观","path":"knowledge/other/游戏大局观.json","aliases":[],"entities":[],"related":[],"claim_annotations":[{"id":"g-5ead5028eafa17609fdb","text_ref":"g-2129555de1f4d5070b83","section":"中期发展","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-43e5dddcdc3fba2a1fe7fbf9784309d4cbe586ff232964e52284b194c2974c1c","paragraph_start":11,"paragraph_end":12}],"condition":"","version":null,"display_ref":"g-2129555de1f4d5070b83"},{"id":"g-0a98cc2dae59496c1a52","text_ref":"g-d68ac9bbb4de17aabcb2","section":"转型与投入","kind":"conditional_strategy","origin":"document","inference":false,"evidence":[{"type":"document","source":"doc-9baf8134cbe312add21f169a29e047768e02eb03bfa0cc9399b1e49c07484de4","paragraph_start":1,"paragraph_end":4}],"condition":"","version":null,"display_ref":"g-d68ac9bbb4de17aabcb2"},{"id":"claim-rw-simple-game-macro","text_ref":"rw-simple-game-macro","display_ref":"rw-simple-game-macro","section":"后期收束","condition":"","version":null,"kind":"general_strategy","origin":"video","inference":true,"evidence":[{"source":"BV1t6Jv6hEEN:p1","start":180.97,"end":210.33},{"source":"BV1t6Jv6hEEN:p1","start":318.75,"end":347.73},{"source":"BV1SyJt6yEjS:p1","start":306.93,"end":335.89}]},{"id":"claim-rw-simple-draft-game-macro","text_ref":"rw-simple-draft-game-macro","display_ref":"rw-simple-draft-game-macro","section":"前期目标","kind":"general_strategy","condition":"","version":null,"origin":"video","inference":true,"evidence":[{"source":"BV14j4F61Eh1:p1","start":241.18,"end":267.92},{"source":"BV14j4F61Eh1:p1","start":353.72,"end":400.67},{"source":"BV14j4F61Eh1:p1","start":520.7,"end":572.19},{"source":"BV14j4F61Eh1:p1","start":735,"end":762.68}]}],"manual_sections":[],"body_sha256":"9b61f088cef77a03cadd69c201da3821fa4e5fd945f3c6f6d33b6ebc548877a1","revision":"1481c563e8295f140853","review_receipts":[],"retired_claim_annotations":[],"node_annotations":{"n-0eb1de62a6360866bf1b":{"origin":"manual","section":"知识内容"}},"manual_semantics":true}}}
